    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for both owning and non-owning symbol-string ptrs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All symbol-string ptrs are convertible to bool, dereferenceable and comparable.</para>
<para>SymbolStringPtrBases are default-constructible and constructible from nullptr to enable comparison with these values. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
